  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Entrepre &amp; Capital Mkt Adjust. Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is to remove constraints to a more active private sector participation in the development process, through the following: (a) creation of an improved environment for enterpreneural activity and investment in labour-intensive activities; (b) deepening of the financial markets; and (c) re-orientation of fiscal and labour policies towards human capital development.</narrative>
  </description>
